  <div class="pad">
    <h1>Custom editors are having a moment</h1>
    <p class="lede">Three extensions shipped custom editors this week and every one of them
      made the same trade-off around webview isolation. We pulled the diffs apart.</p>
    <div class="byline">
      <img src="https://cdn.sidebar.example/authors/rk.jpg" alt="">
      <span>Riley Kwan &middot; 6 min read</span>
    </div>

    <div class="story">
      <img class="t" src="cid:th1@sb" alt="">
      <div><div class="k">Deep dive</div>
        <h2>Why your webview CSP isn't doing what you think</h2>
        <p>A srcdoc frame inherits the parent policy, and the two intersect.</p></div>
    </div>
    <div class="story">
      <img class="t" src="cid:th2@sb" alt="">
      <div><div class="k">Benchmarks</div>
        <h2>A 40% faster tree-sitter parse path landed</h2>
        <p>What changed, and what it means for large files.</p></div>
    </div>

